{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,300],[1000018,4],[1000019,99000018],[1000020,3],[1000021,40000001],[1000022,0],[1000023,0],[1000024,34],[1000025,35],[1000026,36],[1000027,77],[1000028,78],[1000029,33],[1000030,27],[1000031,28],[1000032,38],[1000033,39],[1000034,3],[1000035,25],[1000036,26],[1000037,30],[1000038,37],[1000039,10],[1000040,40],[1000041,41],[1000042,42],[1000043,43],[1000044,53],[1000045,80],[1000046,51],[1000047,24],[1000048,64]],"messages":{"1000000":"Town of Calado\n","1000001":"Town of Calado\n","1000002":"Huh? Who are you?\n","1000003":"Heh heh. You. You're the hired warrior looking for the Tears of Oberon, aren't you?\n","1000004":"If you give me 20,000 in gold, I'll tell you something.\nHow about it?\n           ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000005":"Ha, idiot!\n","1000006":"You'll have a prosperous life.\n","1000007":"You should find a nearby Warp Gate, and\nfind a new warp point.\n","1000008":"Hang in there.\n","1000009":"You don't have enough money.\n","1000010":"So, do you want to buy something or not?\n \n \u30fb~Buy Armaments         ~\n \u30fb~Buy Equipment         ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                                 ~QUIT~\n","1000011":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000012":"You don't have enough money.\n","1000013":"Everything seems fine.\n","1000014":"To identify your item, it costs %d in Gold.  OK?\n \n                                 ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000015":"You don't have anything that you don't already know about.\n","1000016":"I'm Damiel.\nTwenty years have passed since I started my business in this town.\n","1000017":"It was an up-and-coming town back then.\n","1000018":"North of this town is very dangerous\nso it is closed and you can't go up there.\n","1000019":"My name is Marron.\nI'm a holy spirit witch.\n","1000020":"My name means chestnuts in our native language, but I don't like them.\n","1000021":"Holy spirits!\nHeal their wounds!\n","1000022":"Well, you seem healthy now.\n","1000023":"I am Karacchi, a blacksmith.\nMy specialty is ornaments.\n","1000024":"How about changing the color of your armaments\nfor a change?\n","1000025":"Who are you?\n","1000026":"You have nice eyes.\nI'll give you a tip.\n","1000027":"You can find Mandragora\non Lunafuld Beach.\n","1000028":"Who are you?\n","1000029":"Somebody told me that\nthere is a secret medicine called Mental Sauce in the Coldea Ruins,\nwhich is part of the Mesrald Burial Grounds.\n","1000030":"I wonder what it does?\n","1000031":"Gee, this place isn't safe anymore.\n","1000032":"I need to get in shape.\n","1000033":"Anyway, go to the Plain of Dialose\nto pick up the walnuts that have fallen.\n","1000034":"What's up?\n","1000035":"You know what? Chico Nuts are delicious.\n","1000036":"Somebody told me that\nthere are a lot of them at the Meria Ruin in Goronaburb.\n","1000037":"Mmm...\n","1000038":"If only I had Mental Sauce...\nMmm...\n","1000039":"Oh!?\n","1000040":"Mental Sauce!?\nWhere did you get that?\n","1000041":"Give it to me.\nI'll give you something rare in return.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,0,12000000,5],[0,1,12000000,10],[0,0,12000001,26],[0,1,12000001,29],[0,0,12000002,88],[0,1,12000002,96],[0,0,12000003,101],[0,1,12000003,104],[0,0,12000004,108],[0,1,12000004,111],[0,0,12000005,116],[0,1,12000005,119],[0,0,12000006,124],[0,1,12000006,127],[0,0,12000007,132],[0,1,12000007,135],[0,0,12000008,140],[0,1,12000008,147],[0,0,10000300,154],[0,5,4294967295,155],[0,0,10000200,163]],"blocks":[[[6